<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink190-kilavi">
       tōḻi cevilikku aṟattoṭu niṉṟatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       The confidante revealing the truth to the foster mother.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink190">
<l>taṇṇaṟu neytaṟ ṟaḷaiyaviḻ vāṉpū</l>
<l>veṇṇe larinar māṟṟiṉa raṟukku</l>
<l>mellam pulampaṉ maṉṟavem</l>
<l>pallita ḻuṇkaṇ paṉicey tōṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The man from the soft, pretty shores where</l>
        <l>Those who cut the paddy [are also] those who remove</l>
        <l>The pure flower of cool, fragrant Neytal which opens [its] sprout,</l>
        <l>Indeed made cool our kajal-rimmed eyes [resembling] many petals.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
